# the NEGATIVE half of emitc_corpus/cross_unit_private_internal: a definition a
# unit's `public:` block does not list is unreachable from outside. That fixture
# pins that privlib's own internal call to `secret` stays legal; this one pins
# that the check is still there at all -- a walk that stops comparing the
# reference's unit against the definition's would lose the diagnostic silently.
main: function is {
    print "\{privlib.secret n: 5}"
}
